# 27. Definition of success

Phase 3 is successful when TehlayPay can demonstrate three connected capabilities:

**Policy What-If Simulator**
A buyer can explore alternative procurement rules and understand their impact without weakening or changing active policy automatically.

**Intelligent Product Comparison**
A buyer can compare actual Channel3 products using AG Grid, understand their policy outcomes and identify the most suitable compliant option.

**Procurement Decision Passport**
A buyer can generate a professional, traceable record of the procurement request, product evidence, policy decision, approval and verified payment status.

Together, these features should establish TehlayPay as an intelligent procurement governance platform rather than simply an AI-powered shopping application.

**Final instruction:** Prioritise demonstrable functionality, data accuracy, security and a polished end-to-end experience. Protect the existing application. Implement the smallest reliable changes needed to achieve the three features before considering additional enhancements.